        "WORLD_SESSION_LINK_SESSION_ID"
      ],
      "default": "WORLD_SESSION_LINK_UNSPECIFIED",
      "description": "WorldSessionLink tells how a Play was joined to its world session.\n\n - WORLD_SESSION_LINK_CONTAINER_TRUTH: Play metadata names the world session in world_container_truth.\n - WORLD_SESSION_LINK_SESSION_ID: Play metadata has no world_container_truth (the stream was not healthy at\nconnection start); the world session has the same session_id."
